     eqp_LOWER2 = (21.5)*flr_LOWER2*3.6*[15,1]
! Equipment gain for LOWER3, 21.5 W/m² converted to kJ/hr with schedule. eqp_LOWER3 [kJ/hr]; from [15,1] Forcing function output for current day [-]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
