*                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       

  EQUATIONS   1
! DX cooling coil control signal, activated when AHU cooling coil heat transfer is positive. DX_Cooling_Ctrl [-]; from [5,2] Cooling coil heat transfer [kJ/hr]; to -> [6,14] Cooling Control Signal [-]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
     DX_Cooling_Ctrl = GT([5,2], 0)
*$UNIT_NAME DX_Cooling_Control                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
*$LAYER Main                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
*$POSITION 1052 307.0                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
*$UNIT_NUMBER 34                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
